.SS "const CopyPixels = true"

.PP
Copy an offscreen surface's current pixels into an independent \fBImage\fP\&. Read-only boolean constant equal to true\&. The default for \fBImage::Image(Port, boolean)\fP\&. Available in every JavaScript runtime; constructing images from a \fBPort\fP requires graphics support\&. 
.PP
Referenced by \fBImage::Image()\fP\&.
.SS "const SharedSurface = false"

.PP
Share an offscreen surface so later \fBPort\fP drawing updates the \fBImage\fP\&. Read-only boolean constant equal to false\&. Use new \fBpdg\&.Image\fP(port, \fBpdg\&.SharedSurface\fP)\&. The \fBImage\fP retains the surface after the source \fBPort\fP closes\&. Available in every JavaScript runtime; constructing images from a \fBPort\fP requires graphics support\&. 
